# .work/ is the Workspine planning layer for this repo: the plans, decisions, phase
# records and session state that the dogfooded workflow reads and writes. If .work/
# exists in your checkout, start at .work/README.md, which indexes the rest of it.
# It is gitignored on purpose. Planning is private working material and this is a
# public repo, so .work/ is never committed here and is never emitted into a
# generated consumer surface. The consequence is real: a fresh clone of workspine has
# no .work/ and no git history to recover one from. The durable copy lives in the
# private ideaspine repo, mirrored under .private/. If you need the planning layer,
# get it from there. Do not un-ignore this directory to back it up.
.work/

# Local temp files (slides, previews, scratch)
tmp/
distilled.zip
test-gsdd/
.worktrees

# Hash-pinned proof fixtures. All ten Phase 05 proof runners read these four
# by exact name and size, so deleting them breaks the proofs, and committing
# them would publish private planning in a public repo. Named individually on
# purpose: a blanket *.zip would hide a stray archive from `git status`.
/.work.zip
/workspine.zip
/deep-research-report-decision-driven.md
/deep-research-report-decision-driven-second.md
